					"uidString": "rM97z1CARdCh1NAg+DiafQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "They keep external integration code out of core components. They make dependencies explicit. They let Catalyst stay clean while still reaching useful tools and engines."
			},
